# hardware support (list after LCOS hardware.list.chroot). Services without
# systemd: chrony/open-vm-tools ship init scripts; thermald, iio-sensor-proxy,
# switcheroo-control and bolt get omaxian-base's omaxian-* init scripts;
# ipp-usb is started by omaxian-base's udev rule; the rest are data/libraries.
# Clock sync (no systemd-timesyncd); Provides time-daemon
chrony
thermald
iio-sensor-proxy
switcheroo-control
bolt
intel-media-va-driver
# VMware guest (its init script exits outside VMware; spice-vdagent comes
# with omaxian-session)
open-vm-tools
# driverless USB printers/scanners (IPP-over-USB, eSCL/WSD)
ipp-usb
sane-airscan
# network
network-manager
network-manager-gnome
wpasupplicant
iw
# SMB2/3 (Windows/Samba/NAS) mounts: mount.cifs; keyutils for its upcalls
cifs-utils
keyutils
